NOTE ON CATALOG DATA

The MIT license above covers the source code in this repository.

`data/mcp-servers.json` is a sample of aggregated metadata about third-party
MCP servers — names, repository URLs, and descriptions derived from their
public READMEs and registries. Those descriptions remain the property of their
respective authors and are included here under fair use for indexing and
discovery. They are provided as-is, with no license granted beyond that, and
are not covered by the MIT grant above.

The AllMCPs name, logo, wordmark, and the contents of `brand-assets/` are
trademarks of Jackalope Digital and are not licensed for reuse. See
BRAND_GUIDE.md.
